---
// Experience.astro - Visual vertical timeline ("trail") of Rogelio's professional experience
---

<section class="experience-container" id="experiencia">
  <!-- Section Title -->
  <div class="section-title">
    <span class="icon-brackets">&lt;/&gt;</span>
    <h2>Trayectoria Profesional</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="trail-wrapper">
    <!-- Vertical Trail Line -->
    <div class="trail-line"></div>

    <!-- Timeline Node 1: Freelance Developer (Present) -->
    <div class="trail-node">
      <div class="node-dot dot-active">
        <div class="dot-pulse"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="node-content glass-card">
        <div class="node-header">
          <div class="role-company">
            <h3>Freelance Full-Stack Developer</h3>
            <span class="company">Clientes en México & Chile</span>
          </div>
          <span class="node-date present-tag">2023 – Presente</span>
        </div>
        <p class="role-intro">
          Consultoría y desarrollo de punta a punta, implementando integraciones complejas de backend, inteligencia artificial, pasarelas de pago y despliegues optimizados en servidores VPS.
        </p>

        <!-- Sub-projects of Freelance in a compact list -->
        <div class="sub-projects">
          <h4>Proyectos Freelance Destacados:</h4>
          
          <!-- ProtolyLat -->
          <div class="sub-project-item">
            <div class="sub-proj-dot"></div>
            <div class="sub-proj-details">
              <h5>AI Chatbot e-commerce · <span>ProtolyLat</span></h5>
              <p>Plataforma de chat con LLM conectada a Shopify. Integra búsqueda semántica de productos por título/descripción y carrito de compras externo sincronizado vía API.</p>
              <div class="sub-proj-tech">
                <span class="mini-badge">NextJS</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">TypeScript</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">PostgreSQL</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">Redis</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">Docker</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Alfri Chapas -->
          <div class="sub-project-item">
            <div class="sub-proj-dot"></div>
            <div class="sub-proj-details">
              <h5>Sync Shopify & Mercado Libre · <span>Alfri Chapas</span></h5>
              <p>Desarrollo de un sistema sincrónico para publicar y sincronizar productos de Shopify en Mercado Libre con un solo botón, utilizando inteligencia artificial para autorrellenar especificaciones.</p>
              <div class="sub-proj-tech">
                <span class="mini-badge">C#</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">ASP.NET MVC</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">PostgreSQL</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">Redis</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- VictorManeTattoo -->
          <div class="sub-project-item">
            <div class="sub-proj-dot"></div>
            <div class="sub-proj-details">
              <h5>Chat Widget con IA · <span>VictorManeTattoo (NYC)</span></h5>
              <p>Widget de chat inteligente integrado en landing page para agendar citas, responder dudas frecuentes de clientes y portafolio interactivo basado en agente IA de Python.</p>
              <div class="sub-proj-tech">
                <span class="mini-badge">Vite</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">React</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">Python</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">OpenAI API</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FinanzIA -->
          <div class="sub-project-item text-muted-item">
            <div class="sub-proj-dot"></div>
            <div class="sub-proj-details">
              <h5>FinanzIA · <span>Aplicación de Finanzas</span></h5>
              <p>App móvil personal de gestión de gastos, suscripciones y deudas, asistida por chat de IA contextualizado. Publicación en Playstore en prueba cerrada.</p>
              <div class="sub-proj-tech">
                <span class="mini-badge">React Native</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">Expo</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">ExpressJS</span>
                <span class="mini-badge">SQLite</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Node 2: TORKE (2022-2026) -->
    <div class="trail-node">
      <div class="node-dot"></div>
      <div class="node-content glass-card">
        <div class="node-header">
          <div class="role-company">
            <h3>Ingeniero de Software</h3>
            <span class="company">TORKE Trabaja Contigo</span>
          </div>
          <span class="node-date">2022 – 2025</span>
        </div>
        <p class="role-intro">
          Desarrollador principal encargado del soporte, mantenimiento y creación de nuevos productos enlazados al sistema general de ventas y facturación (BMS).
        </p>
        <ul class="achievements-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Optimización de Ventas:</strong> Integración de la API Ventiapp para sincronización física y digital de más de 9,000 productos en marketplaces, incrementando la velocidad de búsqueda de órdenes en un 100%.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>SaaS de Reuniones:</strong> Creación de una plataforma web multi-tenant para minutas de reuniones y asignación de tareas con roles y permisos granularizados, eliminando las fugas de información de antiguos Excels compartidos.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="node-tech-badges">
          <span class="mini-badge">C#</span>
          <span class="mini-badge">ASP.NET</span>
          <span class="mini-badge">SQL Server</span>
          <span class="mini-badge">NextJS</span>
          <span class="mini-badge">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="mini-badge">Microservicios</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience-container {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 3rem 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Title styling */
  .section-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .icon-brackets {
    font-family: var(--font-headers);
    color: var(--primary-light);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .section-title h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  /* Trail / Timeline Wrapper */
  .trail-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  /* Glowing Trail line */
  .trail-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 7px;
    top: 10px;
    bottom: 20px;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      var(--primary-light) 0%,
      rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3) 70%,
      rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.05) 100%
    );
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-full);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
  }

  .trail-node {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Timeline dots */
  .node-dot {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(-2rem - 3px);
    top: 24px;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 3px solid var(--primary-light);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.25);
    z-index: 5;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .node-dot.dot-active {
    border-color: var(--green-dot);
    background-color: var(--green-dot);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.5);
  }

  .dot-pulse {
    position: absolute;
    top: -3px;
    left: -3px;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2.5px solid var(--green-dot);
    animation: nodePulse 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes nodePulse {
    0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: scale(2.2); opacity: 0; }
  }

  .trail-node:hover .node-dot:not(.dot-active) {
    transform: scale(1.2);
    background-color: var(--primary-light);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.5);
  }

  /* Card content */
  .node-content {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .node-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .role-company h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .role-company .company {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary-light);
  }

  .node-date {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background-color: var(--card-border);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-sm);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .node-date.present-tag {
    background-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
    color: var(--green-text);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
  }

  .role-intro {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Achievements list */
  .achievements-list {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .achievements-list li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .achievements-list li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--primary-light);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Technology badges on cards */
  .node-tech-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .mini-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-sm);
    background-color: var(--white-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Sub-projects inside Freelance card */
  .sub-projects {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.15);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sub-projects h4 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .sub-project-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sub-proj-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--primary-light);
    margin-top: 7px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sub-proj-details h5 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .sub-proj-details h5 span {
    color: var(--primary-light);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .sub-proj-details p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sub-proj-tech {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .sub-proj-tech .mini-badge {
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* Responsiveness */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .trail-wrapper {
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
    }

    .trail-line {
      left: 3px;
    }

    .node-dot {
      left: calc(-1.25rem - 5px);
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      top: 24px;
    }

    .dot-pulse {
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
    }

    .node-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .node-content {
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
